# Covers JetBrains IDEs: CLion, DataGrip, GoLand, IntelliJ, PhpStorm, PyCharm, Rider, RubyMine, and WebStorm.
# https://intellij-support.jetbrains.com/hc/en-us/articles/206544839
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore
# Workspace config delegated here from root.

# User-specific files
**/aws.xml
**/shelf/
**/tasks.xml
**/usage.statistics.xml

# Sensitive or high-churn files
**/contentModel.xml
**/dataSources/
**/dataSources.ids
**/dataSources.local.xml
**/dbnavigator.xml
**/dynamic.xml
**/httpRequests/
**/projectSettingsUpdater.xml
**/sqlDataSources.xml
**/uiDesigner.xml
**/workspace.xml
